# The setup menu's keys, one each, as a user presses them: [P] steps the
# printer from Auto to the FX-80, the LaserJet and Auto again, [A] toggles the
# paper, each shown at once; [T] steps through the idle
# timeouts, 10 to 20, 30, 60, 120 and round to 5 s, which the job then ends
# after; [O] opens the folder picker, in /PRINTER: RETURN on ".." goes up to
# the card's root, the cursor keys move between its folders, RETURN opens
# /JOBS and SPACE chooses it; [E] starts the printer. A job printed then (our
# ESC/P pages, sent by PRFILES) lands in the new folder as a PDF, the one
# tools/printer/render writes.
@disk-a tools/dev/builds/disks/escp.st
cardput JOBS/KEEP
text "Machine +: (ST|STE|Mega STE), TOS" 1500
text "\[P\]rinter +: Auto" 300
key p
text "\[P\]rinter +: Epson FX-80" 300
key p
text "\[P\]rinter +: HP LaserJet II" 300
key p
text "\[P\]rinter +: Auto" 300
key a
text "P\[a\]per +: Letter" 300
key a
text "P\[a\]per +: A4" 300
key t
text "\[T\]imeout +: 20 s" 300
key t
text "\[T\]imeout +: 30 s" 300
key t
text "\[T\]imeout +: 60 s" 300
key t
text "\[T\]imeout +: 120 s" 300
key t
text "\[T\]imeout +: 5 s" 300
key o
text "Folder: /PRINTER" 300
text "> \.\." 100
key 0x1c
text "> JOBS/" 300
key 0x50
text "> PRINTER/" 100
key 0x48
text "> JOBS/" 100
key 0x1c
text "Folder: /JOBS" 300
key 0x39
text "F\[o\]lder +: /JOBS" 300
key e
text "Starting the printer" 300
wait 100
key 0x01
wait 900
key 0x39
log "pages: job 00000001 rendered, 3 pages, PDF 32366 bytes" 6000
cardsame JOBS/00000001.pdf tools/dev/builds/disks/escp-expected.pdf
cardnone PRINTER/00000001.pdf
